        <p>Professor Goodfellow says :—" I have carefully analysed the Cambridge Lemonade with entirely satis factory results. It is the nearot approach I bays ever examined to the beverage made from the fresh fruit. It has reached the highest standard in purity and excel- lence." _ _ _</p>
