        <p>!Sir Gilbert Greenall's Pigs.—More Successes. At ;the Peterborough Agricultural Show, Sir Gilbert Greenall was very successful in his exhibits of various classes of pigs. For boar of large white breed he obtained first prize, and first and second for breeding sow of the same kind. For pair of young hoar pigs of the same breed Sir Gilbert ob- tained second and reserve, and for pair of yelts he was awarded first prize. In the class for boar of middle white breed, his exhibits were placed first and secondiand for breeding sow of the same breed he received the first and a econd prizes.</p>
